R'3) is an isopropenyl radical and R4 (or R'4) is hydrogen, thus corresponding to 3- isopropenyl-α,α-dimethylbenzyl-isocyanate (of general designation m-TMI®). The oligomers (b) obtained from said derivatives are preferred;
